  "bio": "Juliette Rahban is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in 'sketch' style tattoos, whose mastery of line art and shading brings an intriguing twist to the strange and twisted themes that dominate her work. Operating out of the esteemed Bouzille de Luxe Tattoo Shop in Clermont-Ferrand, France, Juliette is known for her professional approach, ensuring that each piece she creates is a unique work of art tailored to her clients' desires. Her dedication to her craft is evident in the meticulous details and the vivid imagery she brings to life on skin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Clermont-ferrand, Auvergne-rhone-alpes, France\n\nTatouages, affiches, peintures...l’étrange, le tordu et le fou sont rois.\nÉcris moi un petit mot pour ton projet tattoo 😉!",
